# playpick cell: mode=menus view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# First session to open RECORD's third tab ("bosses", src/render/history.ts)
# and a boss's own notes page (src/notes.ts) at all -- seventeen prior menus
# sessions read the pulls and awards tabs but never this one, even though
# README's "Getting better at it" section is built partly around it. Kill
# Bonegrinder 10-normal in this invocation, then check whether its page
# reflects what was actually shown/eaten, whether an unfought boss's page
# reads honestly blank, and whether the page's own "ALL BOSSES" back label
# actually returns to the boss list rather than exiting the screen (the hit
# test is the same {kind:'back'} either way, so the label is the only thing
# that could lie).
